  'admin',
  'en',
  'Audit trail screen: available soon. The log is already recorded; browsing it here is not built yet.',
  $$## Audit log — available soon

AssessIQ already records every significant administrative action to an
append-only audit log: user changes, grading overrides, certificate
operations, setting updates, and more. That recording runs today.

**The admin screen to browse, filter, and export this log is not built
